      "kind": "new file, gitignored upstream (.gitignore: user.gradle), applied by play-services-core/build.gradle \"if (file('user.gradle').exists()) apply from\"",
      "content": "// APK Web Lab transform 1 (scripts/build-microg.sh): package only the arm64-v8a native libraries. The virtual device's ABI is wasm32, so no ABI runs there.\nandroid.defaultConfig.ndk.abiFilters.clear()\nandroid.defaultConfig.ndk.abiFilters.add(\"arm64-v8a\")\n",
